{
  "name": "Customer RFM Segmentation",
  "description": "Computes RFM (Recency, Frequency, Monetary) scores from order history to segment customers into High Value, At Risk, Lost, and New categories for targeted marketing.",
  "category": "sales",
  "tags": [
    "sales",
    "segmentation",
    "rfm",
    "customer",
    "marketing",
    "retention"
  ],
  "difficulty": "intermediate",
  "containers": [
    {
      "id": "ctr_rfm1",
      "title": "Step 1 - Load & Prepare Order Data",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "rgba(59,130,246,0.07)",
      "headerColor": "#3b82f6",
      "collapsed": false,
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ctr_rfm2",
      "title": "Step 2 - Compute RFM Scores",
      "x": 790,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "rgba(34,197,94,0.07)",
      "headerColor": "#16a34a",
      "collapsed": false,
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ctr_rfm3",
      "title": "Step 3 - Assign Segments & Export",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "rgba(245,158,11,0.07)",
      "headerColor": "#f59e0b",
      "collapsed": false,
      "disabled": false
    }
  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "comment_rfm1",
      "text": "### RFM Segmentation Pipeline\n- **Input CSV**: Expects columns: CustomerID, OrderDate, OrderValue\n- **DateTime**: Normalizes OrderDate to ISO format\n- **Summarize**: Aggregates per customer: last order date, order count, total spend\n- **Formula**: Scores R (recency), F (frequency), M (monetary) on 1-5 scale\n- **Segments**: High Value (RF>=8), At Risk (R<3, F>=3), Lost (R<3, F<3), New (F<3, R>=4)",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#f59e0b"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_in",
      "type": "input_data",
      "name": "Input Order History (CSV)",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "file_path": "orders.csv",
        "file_type": "csv",
        "delimiter": ",",
        "has_header": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_af",
      "type": "auto_field",
      "name": "Auto Field Types",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "fields": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_dt",
      "type": "date_time",
      "name": "Parse Order Date",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "column": "OrderDate",
        "conversion_type": "string_to_date",
        "format_template": "yyyy-MM-dd",
        "output_column": "OrderDate_ISO"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_sum",
      "type": "summarize",
      "name": "Aggregate per Customer",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "actions": [
          {
            "field": "CustomerID",
            "action": "GroupBy",
            "output_name": "CustomerID"
          },
          {
            "field": "OrderDate_ISO",
            "action": "Max",
            "output_name": "LastOrderDate"
          },
          {
            "field": "OrderValue",
            "action": "Count",
            "output_name": "OrderCount"
          },
          {
            "field": "OrderValue",
            "action": "Sum",
            "output_name": "TotalSpend"
          },
          {
            "field": "OrderValue",
            "action": "Average",
            "output_name": "AvgOrderValue"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_formula",
      "type": "formula",
      "name": "Compute RFM Scores",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "formulas": [
          {
            "output_field": "FrequencyScore",
            "type": "integer",
            "expression": "IF([OrderCount] >= 10, 5, IF([OrderCount] >= 6, 4, IF([OrderCount] >= 3, 3, IF([OrderCount] >= 2, 2, 1))))"
          },
          {
            "output_field": "MonetaryScore",
            "type": "integer",
            "expression": "IF([TotalSpend] >= 5000, 5, IF([TotalSpend] >= 2000, 4, IF([TotalSpend] >= 1000, 3, IF([TotalSpend] >= 500, 2, 1))))"
          },
          {
            "output_field": "RFM_Score",
            "type": "integer",
            "expression": "[FrequencyScore] + [MonetaryScore]"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_seg",
      "type": "formula",
      "name": "Assign Segment Label",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 170,
      "config": {
        "formulas": [
          {
            "output_field": "Segment",
            "type": "string",
            "expression": "IF([RFM_Score] >= 8, \"High Value\", IF([FrequencyScore] >= 3, \"At Risk\", IF([FrequencyScore] < 3 AND [MonetaryScore] >= 3, \"Promising\", \"Needs Attention\")))"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_sort",
      "type": "sort",
      "name": "Sort by RFM Score",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 130,
      "config": {
        "sort_by": [
          {
            "column": "RFM_Score",
            "ascending": false
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_out",
      "type": "output_data",
      "name": "Export Customer Segments",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 130,
      "config": {
        "filename": "customer_rfm_segments",
        "format": "xlsx",
        "write_mode": "overwrite"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rfm_browse",
      "type": "browse",
      "name": "Preview Segments",
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 260,
      "config": {}
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
    {
      "id": "crf1",
      "source": "node_rfm_in",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_af",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "crf2",
      "source": "node_rfm_af",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_dt",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "crf3",
      "source": "node_rfm_dt",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_sum",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "crf4",
      "source": "node_rfm_sum",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_formula",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "crf5",
      "source": "node_rfm_formula",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_seg",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "crf6",
      "source": "node_rfm_seg",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_sort",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "crf7",
      "source": "node_rfm_sort",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_out",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    },
    {
      "id": "crf8",
      "source": "node_rfm_sort",
      "sourceHandle": "O",
      "target": "node_rfm_browse",
      "targetHandle": "I"
    }
  ]
}